   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p style=\"margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\">A. Find c and n0 to show f(n) = n^4 + 3n^3 + 2n + 1 is &Omega;(g(n)) where g(n) = n^3 + 4</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:8px\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-32.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">B) Find c and n0 to show f(n) = 3n + 2 is O(g(n)) where </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">g(n) = n .&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n",
