   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p style=\"margin-right:48px; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:24px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mani is a shop owner he wants to count the number of balls available in the box. The balls are numbered, we need to create a software to accept n number of balls and we need to display the count in each number. Write the C program to solve the problem and find the time complexity function of the program.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
